AMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 가상계좌납부 가능합니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 알림사항</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 분할납부 2차~4차 납부기간에 납부알림 문자를 발송할 예정입니다.&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;휴대전화 번호가 변경되는 경우 경리팀(054-478-7115)으로&nbsp;연락</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013. 02. 12.</span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">사 무 국 장</span></span></span><br></font></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
